    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Keziah! A newly ascended Enforcer whose duty is to carry out the will of her goddess, Anthea. In this action-fantasy platformer, you'll face deadly enemies and avoid dangerous traps as you delve into a divine temple to fulfill your sacred mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Agile gameplay focused on movement and quick reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A short yet satisfying traversal experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Challenging achievements for seasoned adventurers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on enemies or dash through them with a deadly attack to defeat them. Bounce on walls, climb vines, and glide as you venture deeper into the temple, dodging threats with precision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is a lesson rather than something to fear \u2014 while inside the temple, you'll rise again by Anthea\u2019s power until your task is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The temple spirits await your arrival. Save them from the evil corrupting your sacred land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keziah\u2019s mission is only just beginning\u2026 Are you ready to fulfill the divine will?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Keziah! A newly ascended Enforcer whose duty is to carry out the will of her goddess, Anthea. In this action-fantasy platformer, you'll face deadly enemies and avoid dangerous traps as you delve into a divine temple to fulfill your sacred mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Agile gameplay focused on movement and quick reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A short yet satisfying traversal experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Challenging achievements for seasoned adventurers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on enemies or dash through them with a deadly attack to defeat them. Bounce on walls, climb vines, and glide as you venture deeper into the temple, dodging threats with precision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is a lesson rather than something to fear \u2014 while inside the temple, you'll rise again by Anthea\u2019s power until your task is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The temple spirits await your arrival. Save them from the evil corrupting your sacred land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keziah\u2019s mission is only just beginning\u2026 Are you ready to fulfill the divine will?</p>",
    "short_description": "Stand in Keziah\u2019s footsteps and heed the Divine Order. Jump your way through, reclaim your goddess\u2019s temple, obliterate enemies, and find the Tear of Creation in this beautiful platformer game!",
